Verified on the Paraguay basis (2026-10-28): every NCPP version's wording comes from an official text-layer source (MINJUS 8th official edition and its Texto anterior footnotes; Congreso ADLP texts of Leyes 32181, 32182, 32255, 32374, each paragraph checked word for word), and the state at the 8th-edition point (17 Nov 2024) equals that edition's text exactly for all 603 provisions; no official consolidation after it exists. Not found and not included: laws after Ley 32537 (26 Dec 2025) and decretos legislativos after Nov 2024, including D.Leg. 1735 (Feb 2026) and Ley 32735 (Jul 2026), which a web search names as amending the Code.
